Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the old Hotcray scancode map (CapsLock->Backspace, Numpad5->Space,
; Numpad7->VolumeUp, Numpad1->VolumeDown). kanata does all of this now, and
; it must see the real keys. Double-click, confirm, then sign out/restart.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout]
"Scancode Map"=-
